                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8530d6eb-dede-4114-93df-6871336b2a88",
                        "source_entry_id": "45477642-a4ea-3edd-8444-470e433098c8",
                        "source_sense_id": "0d3f5e82-3d10-3939-8270-ee1bbe246fba",
                        "target_lang_word": "declassify",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "declassify",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e7a65d95-43a6-32be-9f5b-63f60c7a4bcd",
                                        "entry_id": "c3707144-8ace-3c0d-bdaf-ccaa960b15e5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "to remove the classification from; to lift the restrictions on"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "40f9ea2a-9531-44bf-ac36-7076a6441fd0",
                                                "sense_id": "e7a65d95-43a6-32be-9f5b-63f60c7a4bcd",
                                                "text": "Trump: This was done by the military and given to me. Uh, I think we can probably, right? / Staffer: I don't know, well, we'll have to see. Yeah, we'll have to try to- / Trump: Declassify it. / Staffer: -figure out a- yeah. / Trump: See as president I could have declassified it. Now I can't, you know, but this is still a secret. / Staffer: Yeah. [Laughter] Now we have a problem. / Trump: Isn't that interesting? / Staffer: Yeah. / Trump: It's so cool."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a8d89d0c-0ccf-440f-9417-3b9ead02c2ae",
                                                "sense_id": "e7a65d95-43a6-32be-9f5b-63f60c7a4bcd",
                                                "text": "There are also two First Class compartments, but these have been declassified for suburban services and will be available to all customers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4bfef2b7-0ebe-44e4-bd47-c9598667aa5b",
                        "source_entry_id": "45477642-a4ea-3edd-8444-470e433098c8",
                        "source_sense_id": "0d3f5e82-3d10-3939-8270-ee1bbe246fba",
                        "target_lang_word": "rendre public",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "rendre public",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "32e0da2a-fdcf-3313-bcf9-8700db19b11f",
                                        "entry_id": "31b9f1a1-e03b-370f-8adf-20f08ba4d7bc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Publier de façon notoire."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2de08f01-2f34-47c1-ab1b-cdbb50858239",
                                                "sense_id": "32e0da2a-fdcf-3313-bcf9-8700db19b11f",
                                                "text": "Le secours allait venir aux révisionnistes du côté où on l’attendait le moins. Une pièce du dossier secret, deux fois rendue publique, se trouva être un faux."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "90bfa24d-43ec-4870-9658-34d0c732149a",
                                                "sense_id": "32e0da2a-fdcf-3313-bcf9-8700db19b11f",
                                                "text": "L’autoritativité peut donc être définie comme une attitude consistant à produire et à rendre public des textes, à s’auto-éditer ou à publier sur le WWW, sans passer par l’assentiment d’institutions de référence référées à l’ordre imprimé."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e1e8d38c-31d1-4783-b78e-0d6bfdf6cdf0",
                        "source_entry_id": "45477642-a4ea-3edd-8444-470e433098c8",
                        "source_sense_id": "0d3f5e82-3d10-3939-8270-ee1bbe246fba",
                        "target_lang_word": "lever le secret",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3111bb17-0b46-46f8-b9d2-fa34f39e8c32",
                        "source_entry_id": "45477642-a4ea-3edd-8444-470e433098c8",
                        "source_sense_id": "0d3f5e82-3d10-3939-8270-ee1bbe246fba",
                        "target_lang_word": "déclassifier",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "déclassifier",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a1c2edde-c281-3e70-a6a1-24f368b5d129",
                                        "entry_id": "75f101a5-f6d7-3597-b21f-6ded121b1d47",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Défaire une classification."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f91710cf-db27-3287-8894-4a07debbc22c",
                                        "entry_id": "75f101a5-f6d7-3597-b21f-6ded121b1d47",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Enlever son caractère secret en parlant de documents militaires ou gouvernementaux."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3bdf72aa-adde-4e09-abb7-0e59fd2088b6",
                                                "sense_id": "f91710cf-db27-3287-8894-4a07debbc22c",
                                                "text": "L’Allemagne a déclassifié les archives de la Stasi."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5c0d30b6-7a9b-44bb-8b12-312bf5d43b66",
                                                "sense_id": "f91710cf-db27-3287-8894-4a07debbc22c",
                                                "text": "Juste avant de quitter Beauvau, le 11 mai, l’éphémère ministre de l’Intérieur Matthias Fekl a accepté, à la demande des Juges Tournaire et Buresi, de déclassifier des documents en provenance de la Direction générale de la sécurité intérieure."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7078e5c6-cde3-3f38-9f6f-753a0a108988",
                                        "entry_id": "75f101a5-f6d7-3597-b21f-6ded121b1d47",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sortir des classifications."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "pronominal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c88e1df9-5073-489a-b39d-cca393fd0dc2",
                                                "sense_id": "7078e5c6-cde3-3f38-9f6f-753a0a108988",
                                                "text": "Non content d’épurer jusqu’au raffinement son esthétique et sa pratique, l’art se déclassifie et s’universalise ; il franchit des limites arbitraires [à propos des peintures de sculpteurs]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
